    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Now presenting 56 Season Meadows. One of only two Bungalows launching in this development.\r\n\r\nSet in a peaceful yet well-connected location, this new community offers an ideal balance of rural tranquillityand modern convenience. Season Meadows comprises 25 high-quality 2-, 3- and 4-bedroom houses each meticulously designed for the needs of today’s families.\r\n\r\nInside, these homes exude a modern yet homely luxury, with bright open-plan layouts both inviting and effortlessly functional. Each property is equipped with a state-of-the-art air-to-water heating system, providing excellent energy efficiency, while underfloor heating on the ground floor ensures a warm and comfortable environment throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThe heart of every home is the beautifully designed kitchen. These featuring elegant Everest White Quartz countertops complete with matching upstand and splashback. A combination of glass-fronted cabinetry and solid doors adds sophistication and practicality of these homes.\r\n Luxurious chestnut plank laminated oak wood flooring enhances the ground floor living spaces. Bathrooms and en-suites feature elegant Sonas sanitary ware, combining style with long-lasting durability.\r\n\r\nEvery home in Season Meadows balances comfort with contemporary style, creating warm and welcoming spaces perfect for both family life and entertaining. Outside, each property benefits from its own private landscaped garden — perfect for al fresco dining, playtime, or relaxing evenings outdoors.\r\n\r\nEach Garden having a seeded lawn at the rear and a cobbleblock front pavement. Each house is finished with Monocouche render externally.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n•\tModern air-to-water heating systems\r\n•\tUnderfloor heating on the ground floor, with radiator heating on the first floor. \r\n•\tQuality-crafted kitchens, complete with Everest White Quartz countertops\r\n•\tA refined mix of glass-fronted cabinetry and solid doors, adding elegance and functionality\r\n•\tSonas high-quality sanitary ware in bathrooms\r\n•\tLuxurious oak wood flooring and premium finishes throughout\r\n•\tPrivate gardens\r\n\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been chosen to create homes that feel bright yet cosy, stylish yet homely, and unmistakably welcoming.\r\nSeason Meadows offers a lifestyle where nature, comfort, and convenience come together effortlessly — the perfect place to build your future in Wicklow.\r\nA place to call home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Highlights\r\n\r\n•\tA2-Rated Spacious Homes – Energy-efficient, sustainably built, and designed for lower running costs and year-round comfort.\r\n•\tExceptional Finishes – Premium sanitary ware and designer kitchen fittings throughout.\r\n•\tExpertly Landscaped Gardens – Private outdoor spaces ideal for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n•\tVibrant Community Living – A warm, welcoming neighbourhood atmosphere.\r\n•\tPrime Location – Walking distance to Newtownmountkennedy Village and close to Greystones, Wicklow Town, and Dublin City Centre.\r\n•\tUnder 10-Year Home Bond Warranty."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Directions\r\nLocation & Lifestyle\r\n\r\nNewtownmountkennedy, located in the heart of County Wicklow, offers an exceptional lifestyle surrounded by natural beauty while remaining perfectly connected for modern living. Known for its warm community spirit and flourishing local amenities, Season Meadows is just a 4 minute walking distance from the village and all amenities.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy:\r\n•\tCharming cafés, shops, and family-friendly services\r\n•\tRestaurants and pubs\r\n•\tBeautiful walking trails, parks, and green spaces\r\n•\tQuick access to some of Wicklow’s most iconic landmarks, including Sugar Loaf Mountain, The infamous Wicklow Mountains, Powerscourt Waterfall, Kindlestown Woods, and the breathtaking scenery of Lough Tay\r\n\r\nConvenience is at the forefront with excellent transport links:\r\n•\tEasy access to the N11/M11\r\n•\tShort drive to Greystones with DART and rail services\r\n•\tLocal bus routes connecting to Bray, Greystones, and Dublin\r\n\r\nFamilies benefit from:\r\n•\tNewtownmountkennedy Primary School within minutes\r\n•\tA selection of respected secondary schools in Greystones, just a ten-minute drive away\r\n•\tNearby childcare facilities, sports clubs, and wellness amenities\r\n•\tDoctor Surgery\r\n•\tHotel for the convenience of visiting family members\r\n•\tPharmacy\r\n•\tSupermarkets\r\nViewing Details\r\nContact Us\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a private viewing of the show home, please contact our sales team:\r\n\r\nPhone:  01 276 0033\r\nEmail: sales@mcdonnellproperties.com"
      }
    ],
